{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1395238-solars-demand-a-context-redux-forum-game","id":1395238,"title":"SOLARS DEMAND A CONTEXT! REDUX (Forum Game)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-08T22:03:42-07:00","id":1395238,"title":"SOLARS DEMAND A CONTEXT! REDUX (Forum Game)","content":"original thread: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ext-forum-game</a><br /> <br /> This is a game where a person writes an out of context quote and the next post gives it a context for the Exalted universe. Now the second post puts up another quote to which a third person will try to place into Creation/Malfeas/the Underworld/Yu Shan/etc and put up yet another quote, and so on so for.<br /> <br /> Example:<br /> Post A: 'To be or not to be - that is the question'<br /> <br /> Post B: A chosen of serenity deciding if a love affair between a noble and a fishmonger should proceed.<br /> 'IF YOU DESTROY THE BRIDGE, YOU'LL NEVER SEE HER AGAIN!'<br /> <br /> Post C: A Solar is being taunted by the Mask of Winters as the former has only one chance to destroy the Death Lord, by using an evocation to incinerate a bridge with both the Exalt's true love and the undead tyrant. And the bridge was built over Oblivion, because Neverborn!<br /> 'I wanted to change the world too, but I changed nothing'<br /> <br /> Some rules before we start:<br /> 1) Quote can be from anywhere; history, fiction or just an old proverb. Just not from Exalted literature or any game of Exalted.<br /> 2) Do not reveal the source of the quote until some has given it context for Exalted by another poster. You may reveal the source at any later date.<br /> 3) The quote must be applicable to the Exalted universe, no terms or place names that do not fit into Creation or are specific to reality/a particular fictional universe; for example both America and Gotham city cannot be used.<br /> <br /> First quote: <br /> &quot;<i>&quot;I don't know about you guys, but... I kinda want to slay the dragon.&quot;</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-09T14:08:16-07:00","id":1395458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FMA245</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1395238-solars-demand-a-context-redux-forum-game#post1395238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">original thread: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/881212-solars-demand-a-context-forum-game\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ext-forum-game</a><br /> <br /> <br /> First quote:<br /> &quot;<i>&quot;I don't know about you guys, but... I kinda want to slay the dragon.&quot;</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Uttered by the Azimuth Infernal to the rest of his fully Infernal circle, as they realize that the Ebon Dragon has done the predictable and screwed them over.<br /> <br /> <br /> Next quote:<br /> &quot;I think that I shall go forth with fewer gifts from wolves, from now on.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>She/Her pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12975-zealot_vedas","name":"Zealot_Vedas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12975_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-10T12:41:38-07:00","id":1395650,"title":"","content":"Said by the Eclipse Caste Taeku after her Northeastern outfit, a gift of three tribes between which she has brokered a peace agreement, resulted in her arrest and trial as an enemy of the King in a nearby region. She did manage an acquittal, but decided to adopt a less provocative manner of dress.<br /> <br /> \u201cWho among you would give your child a stone when asked for bread, or a serpent when asked for a fish?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}